[[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Open the tailgate and remove the bulb holder, working from the\nside shown in the figure.</p><p>2. Disconnect the electrical connection.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Boot courtesy light</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890340\">G40</a></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2035743.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,63,0,"<p>1. If necessary, remove the cover and replace the bulb.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2035744.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the bulb holder\nis undamaged.</p><p>If removed, fit the bulb and then the cover.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection.</p><p>Fit the bulb holder.</p><p>Check that the boot light works.</p>"]]